ssion discussing the evolving world of sustainable investments and the path ahead for climate capital. </div><div class="text-block-3"><div class="text-block-3"></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6"><div class="columns-15 w-row"><div class="w-col w-col-6"><div class="uui-testimonial15_client"><div class="uui-testimonial15_client-image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/6a721d1a2ba729b26f747fff_jimcoulter.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 193px, (max-width: 767px) 88px, 79px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/6a721d1a2ba729b26f747fff_jimcoulter-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/6a721d1a2ba729b26f747fff_jimcoulter.jpeg 800w" alt="" class="uui-testimonial15_customer-image"/></div><div class="uui-testimonial15_client-info"><div class="uui-testimonial15_client-heading"><a href="#https://www.linkedin.com/in/jim-coulter-64a197281/" target="_blank">Jim Coulter </a></div><div class="uui-text-size-small">Founding Partner &amp; Executive Chairman, TPG</div></div></div></div><div class="w-col w-col-6"></div></div></div><div class="text-block-3"><strong class="bold-text-7">10:15 am<br/>‍</strong></div><div class="text-block-2"><strong>The State of Climate Capital <br/></strong>This session will bring together leaders across climate asset classes - including private markets, public markets, real estate, and infrastructure - to explore the current state of climate capital and what comes next for the market.</div><div class="text-block-3"></div><div class="w-row"><div class="w-col w-col-6"><div class="uui-testimonial15_client"><div class="uui-testimonial15_client-image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/6a68c9e0cb88b6036c4ac88b_jameswest.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 407px, (max-width: 767px) 198px, 180px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/6a68c9e0cb