</svg></div></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div data-w-id="45ae8ead-c8bf-e826-1c2b-54bb7a8f7ed9" class="faq-question"><h3 class="heading regular">I have a different question</h3><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cb7657527430c96178b797/67cb7657527430c96178b8aa_b1bac07ef2634ffa06bfac10db0469c7_plus-bold.svg" alt="Plus icon" class="faq-icon"/></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq-answer"><p class="paragraph-3">You can email events@equal.vc for other inquiries. <br/><br/>Please do not reach out in regards to invites – the best way to do that is through the &#x27;Request an Invite&#x27; form on this website.</p><div class="spacer-40"></div></div><div class="corner-cuts-wrapper text-color-100"><div class="corner-cut-top-left small w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 72 72" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
